fig('Current local software structure','The API serves interactions; background work continues from saved activity and due opportunities.','02-containers','Shared durable state connects student interactions to later support.',[25,26], 'Logical local configuration. The database and deployment topology have not won a comparative scaling study.')
fig('Data relationships behind continuing support','Each conversation and goal belongs to a student and a published course version.','03-erd','Goal completion must select evidence for the right student, release and target concepts.',[23,25], 'Physical ER subset. Crow’s foot = many; circle = optional. Goal-to-assessment matching is an application rule, not a direct foreign key.')
