fig('Two entry points into the same saved system','A student request starts a response; due saved work can start support later.','12-execution','Both paths recheck authority before saving their effects.',[3,4,25,26], 'UML sequence overview. A worker acts only when goal, evidence, consent and schedule checks permit support.')
fig('Current factual-answer path','BM25 ranks words in the permitted course evidence. The answer path checks support and selects facts.','06-answer-path','Keep a simple, inspectable answer path while improving completeness.',[7,11,25], 'BM25 is a keyword-based ranking method. The retained path assembles approved facts deterministically; richer wording paths are experimental.')
