fig('Why the more complex answer paths failed','Three historical paths used the same course evidence; two shared the same overly broad check.','07-answer-alternatives','Checking all question wording rejected cases whose required answer facts were available.',[8,9], 'These are separate UML activities. The result concerns the tested answer paths, not the value of event sourcing in general.')
